WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.912
Language models are optimized to produce plausible continuations, not to guarantee that every statement is true.

00:00:07.912 --> 00:00:13.567
A polished answer can still contain unsupported details, wrong dates, or fabricated sources.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:19.822
Fluency should never be treated as evidence of correctness.

00:00:19.822 --> 00:00:23.542
Confidence in tone is not confidence in fact.

00:00:23.542 --> 00:00:27.855
A smooth paragraph and a correct answer are two different properties.
